# OpenSSL (Debian 3.5.7-1~deb13u3 in every brick)
#
# Accepted with no [[ignore]]: the 10 OpenSSL CVEs open in trixie with no
# Debian fix (CVE-2026-95691, -88822, -124709, -95692, -88823, -107496,
# -107493, -35190, -95690, -84786; the OpenSSL platform entry). NVD has matched
# none, so no finding exists to ignore. Owner approved 2026-11-20 at the v0.6
# release gate's G11 ("Release, review later", relayed by the wave driver):
# v0.6 is released with them open. Reason: no Debian fix exists; Low upstream;
# no QUIC, DTLS, CMS, GCM-SIV, DANE or Suite B on any served path. Review at
